From ab06d563892a70d6981ab9daf84849b16fefc9c8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mio <mio@mio19.uk>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 19:25:44 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] add old-kernel compatibility patches (overlay/systemd)

Add the systemd 262 compatibility patches needed by the 4.14 vendor
kernels: mountpoint and faccessat fallbacks, pidfd and close_range
fallbacks, proc credentials without the new mount API, and the
epoll_pwait2 EINVAL fallback. Keep the patches in one series entry so
the old-kernel work is not split across unrelated commits.
