 .../systemd-262-epoll-pwait2-old-kernel.patch |  19 +++
 .../systemd-262-pidfd-old-kernel.patch        |  37 +++++
 ...temd-262-proc-credentials-old-kernel.patch |  41 +++++
 7 files changed, 365 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
